OL,3,GNEWSABritish woman abducted in Malawi,
OL,4,Apolice say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in Malawi are investigating the
OL,7,Fkidnapping of a British national who
OL,8,Fwas abducted in the southern African
OL,9,Fnation's main city, Blantyre.
OL,11,FNusrat Osman, 47, was seized at around
OL,12,F12:30 local time on Friday by four men
OL,13,Fwho had been travelling in a grey
OL,14,FNissan Dualis, according to a police
OL,15,Fstatement.
OL,17,FThe authorities have offered a reward
OL,18,Fof more than $17,000 (#12,600) for
OL,19,F"credible information" that could lead
OL,20,Fto the rescue of the mother of two
OL,21,Fyoung children and the prosecution of
OL,22,Fthe perpetrators.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
